   Algorithm:
   1. Snapshot/update trace sets and advance active/fading lifetimes and interpolation.
   2. Walk postTickTraceEntries and register live entries for VFX-finished callbacks.
   3. Release or dispose retained references.
   4. When fTraceFinished is set, invoke the one-shot completion callback at +0x460 with context
   +0x468 and arguments +0x410/+0x414, then clear only +0x460.
   
